    "detailed_description": "In Weather Dominance you take on the role of a cloud with 6 different abilities (rain, lightning, wind, snow, hail, and storm).<br><br>The objective is to defeat enemies who are destroying the environment and solve puzzles to help friendly NPCs.  Each enemy or puzzle can be solved multiple different ways, but some weather abilities will get the job done more easily.<br><br>The game consists of a randomly generated map with 3-6 areas to explore, and each of the 3 days has a newly generated map.  At the end of each day, you will encounter a boss fight that will yield an upgrade bubble if you can defeat it.<br><br>Every playthrough is a completely different experience with randomly generated levels, enemies, puzzles, rewards and bosses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422990/extras/18163160cdc5becb4e0c177814c51f41.poster.avif?t=1739963907\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422990/extras/18163160cdc5becb4e0c177814c51f41.webm?t=1739963907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422990/extras/18163160cdc5becb4e0c177814c51f41.mp4?t=1739963907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422990/extras/c4185fb7f1ae5ebdf8af9be2859c7b4b.poster.avif?t=1739963907\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422990/extras/c4185fb7f1ae5ebdf8af9be2859c7b4b.webm?t=1739963907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422990/extras/c4185fb7f1ae5ebdf8af9be2859c7b4b.mp4?t=1739963907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Feel free to hangout on the discord server</strong><br><br>",
